## B. 当前 Agent Runtime 实际路径（复杂路径）

```
intent_gateway.run_intent_gateway(text)            intent_gateway.py:37
  → GoalDecisionEngine().ingest(text)              intent_gateway.py:60-62  → goal_decision_engine.py
  → engine.submit(dec, intent_id)                  intent_gateway.py:100     → agent_runtime.submit_goal → goals.create_goal
  （发布 INTENT_* / GOAL_CREATED 领域事件，单一来源 publish_domain）

agent_runtime._run_goal / _execute_task            agent_runtime.py:507
  _execute_task(goal_id, task, tool, args)         agent_runtime.py:519
    ├ skill:*   → _execute_skill_task → execute_tool(skill_handle, args)   agent_runtime.py:520-521, 715
    ├ external.mcp.* → _execute_mcp_task
    │     → capability_os.execute_capability(cap_id, auto_approve=True, goal_id)  agent_runtime.py:641,651-653
    │         → mcp_host.executor._authorize(policy_engine.evaluate(default_deny=True))  mcp_host/executor.py:38-40
    │         → MCPExecutor → 外部工具
    ├ is_known(capability) → _execute_computer_task
    │     → guard.plan(...)                        agent_runtime.py:605  (permission_guard 单例)
    │     → guard.run(..., default_deny=True)      agent_runtime.py:608  (Policy Engine 裁决 + request_approval)
    │     → computer_executor.execute + VerificationLayer.verify
    └ 其余工具：
          policy.evaluate(tool, args, goal_id, default_deny=True)   agent_runtime.py:543  ← 完整 Policy 门
